              <p>GLEIF publishes updated <span><a href="https://www.gleif.org/en/lei-data/gleif-concatenated-file/about-the-concatenated-file">Concatenated Files</a></span> daily and has done since 8th June 2015. Individual source files published by <span><a href="https://www.gleif.org/en/about-lei/get-an-lei-find-lei-issuing-organizations">Legal Entity Identifier (LEI) issuing organizations</a></span> before this date, or later files which are not included in Concatenated Files, are available for download below.</p>
<p>The following table provides a link to download a Zip file for each individual LEI issuer, which includes historical LEI files in <span><a href="https://www.gleif.org/en/about-lei/common-data-file-format/previous-versions">LEI-CDF format v1.0</a></span> and/or <span><a href="https://www.gleif.org/en/about-lei/common-data-file-format/previous-versions">LEI-CDF format  v2.1</a></span>. For those users who would like to download the complete set of historical LEI files, this is available for download at the bottom of this page.</p>
